{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、Mステです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカイダイビング\n初披露です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nメンバー編成が特別になってますので\nお楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに出たかったMステに\n2回も連続で出演できて\n本当に嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つけてね～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、その後は\n沈金です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅刻してしまいますが\n聴いてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/06/02/8864285/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、沈金と言えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前\nらりんとご飯行ってきたんですー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんキラキラしてる\nって思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この１年\n自分どうだったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"}